{"availability":"available","full":"H4V1K-dev/axicor","name":"axicor","description":"Neuromorphic Computing Engine. SNN AI Architecture base from biology ","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Rust","stars":96,"forks":19,"created":"2026-02-21T15:51:14Z","updated":"2026-05-16T04:22:00Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"master","homepage":"https://axicor.dev/public","topics":["agi","biological-neural-networks","computational-neuroscience","cuda","embodied-ai","neuromorphic-computing","rust","spiking-neural-networks"],"demo":"https://www.tiktok.com/@alex_0xgenesis_agi/video/7617581624011541781","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T21:33:26.812Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-05T21:33:26.812Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-05T21:33:26.812Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-05T21:33:26.812Z","stars":96,"forks":19}],"technologies":["Rust"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Neuromorphic Computing Engine. SNN AI Architecture base from biology.","A living brain for embodied AI. Learns in seconds. Runs everywhere - from ESP32 microcontrollers to GPU clusters. Axicor is a Spiking Neural Network engine designed for biological realism and absolute determinism. No backpropagation. No static computation graphs. Neurons fire spikes, axons physically grow through 3D space, weak synapses are pruned, strong ones fortified - all in real-time, without halting the simulation.","Watch the live demo -> - an ant agent in Gymnasium-AntV4, no pre-training, walking within 30 seconds of spawn."],"features":["Behavior out of the box. An ant agent spawned in Gymnasium-AntV4 stands upright within seconds and begins exploratory locomotion within 30 seconds of instantiation - with zero pre-training. No gradient descent, no…","Bit-exact determinism across hardware. Integer-only physics (GLIF, GSOP) guarantees identical simulation results on an RTX 4090, AMD RDNA, or an ESP32. No floating-point drift, no cross-platform divergence.","Real-time structural plasticity. Axons physically grow and prune during the Night Phase while the Day Phase hot-loop keeps ticking. No \"training mode\" vs \"inference mode\" divide - the brain rewires itself while it lives.","Modest hardware friendly. Reference demos run on a GTX 1080 Ti. No cloud-scale compute required."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/H4V1K-dev/axicor/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"29bd26a6d7980ee1d6aea7ea4539efaea8a0b5c87ef4f4196c2d37764d87a5ae","extractedAt":"2026-10-05T21:33:26.924Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T21:33:26.924Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Neuromorphic Computing Engine. SNN AI Architecture base from biology.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/H4V1K-dev/axicor/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[{"text":"A living brain for embodied AI. Learns in seconds. Runs everywhere - from ESP32 microcontrollers to GPU clusters. Axicor is a Spiking Neural Network engine designed for biological realism and absolute determinism. No backpropagation. No static computation graphs. Neurons fire spikes, axons physically grow through 3D space, weak synapses are pruned, strong ones fortified - all…","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/H4V1K-dev/axicor/blob/master/README.md"}],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"29bd26a6d7980ee1d6aea7ea4539efaea8a0b5c87ef4f4196c2d37764d87a5ae","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/H4V1K-dev/axicor/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-05T21:33:26.924Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-05-16T04:22:00Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/H4V1K-dev/axicor/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-05T21:33:26.925Z","hash":"29bd26a6d7980ee1d6aea7ea4539efaea8a0b5c87ef4f4196c2d37764d87a5ae","originalBytes":14730,"storedBytes":14730,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["axicor","ant","run","docs","python","src","architecture","bootstrap","build","c-abi","cpu","examples","exp","gpu","memory","mode","network","open","phase","powershell","terminal","agent","axons","bash","brain","clone","cuda